// Recording throughput: batch jobs completed per hour (DIAAT-281). Workload and capacity.
//
// Measure: transcripts completed per hour.
// Formula: sum(value) of transcription.jobs.finished with hmcts.outcome == "success", per
//   hour.
// Source: counter transcription.jobs.finished, recording's own (metrics carry no area),
//   never sampled (OD2).
// Caveats: hours with no completions have no point. Completions depend on demand: low
//   throughput with nothing waiting is not a capacity problem (compare
//   recording_queue_jobs.kql).
customMetrics
| where name == "transcription.jobs.finished"
| where tostring(customDimensions["hmcts.outcome"]) == "success"
| summarize completed = sum(value) by bin(timestamp, 1h)
| order by timestamp asc
